Tested against the current `master`.

System info:
CachyOS Linux #1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Thu, 17 Sep 2026 15:20:14 +0000 on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650 (nvidia; 615.71.09) - 11th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-11400H @ 2.70GHz (12 threads) - 15.39 GiB memory - PulseAudio (44100 Hz, Stereo/mono)

- Test project: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-benchmarks
- Test case: ObjectDB benchmarks
- Build command: `scons -j8 target=template_release production=yes` (using the [latest SDK](https://github.com/godotengine/buildroot) used for official builds).

- Run command: `for i in {1..20}; do ./before.x86_64 --headless -- --run-benchmarks --include-benchmarks="core/object*" --save-json="./before-$i.json" && ./after.x86_64 --headless -- --run-benchmarks --include-benchmarks="core/object*" --save-json="./after-$i.json"; done`

